popup_text = "You take a while to examine the airship, such as it is. It looks like nothing so much as the world's largest skeleton clock, with speheres and tubes bolted on for humans to ride in. The whole thing is absolutely massive, taking up easily three times the space a normal dirigible would."
button_text = "A dirigible has nothing on this."
